y was formerly known as Oriental Veneer Products Limited and changed its name to Oriental Rail Infrastructure Limited in March 2022. Oriental Rail Infrastructure Limited was incorporated in 1991 and is based in Mumbai, India.","employees":198,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1788220800,"asOf":1795774884},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795774884,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Oriental Rail Infrastructure\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Oriental Rail Infrastructure Limited (ORIRAIL.NS)","s":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","d":1795757701,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE5JdjE0WFl1LWhmWkZFQTVCdHg3Vmw5RGRlWW5hSWZxQUZMQl9TQjdfTThwemoyaDUtd19JbXF4bFdyZ09aa2V0RFJxVUlWYThtUGNRTWNCT2NPQUxydDVHSEZ1MWJvRzg?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"LCC Projects JV Secures ₹728.51 Crore Rajasthan Irrigation Project; Shares Rise 5.31%","s":"HDFC Sky","d":1795677332,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQalB2S01OaXlXdG9wRHF0a2drUXJlMjVvQTZRWk0zV25oLWg4T0U4MXBHRkdaeDlMZWxiaENWOE0tU0oyOTVrMUpaeFRsLTFtU2dzZE9PdHJKd2NxdkowdzN4UkoxMk5OdFFKWHJ1bTU1YU5DRnlNRTEwa0tsZmkxMUd6b3NYOTVWd081OENXZUxiM3RBMmRQTXBDdzdSWnpaaXc1M3E4OW1pejdVV0pkZ0Vqazg2SFVGTEE?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Oriental Rail Infrastructure Secures ₹4.11 Crore Railway Coach Seat Order; Shares Rise 1.30%","s":"HDFC Sky","d":1795677022,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPUUs3ZXN0b09YVDFYbzZzWmVteWRvWFVtdkw3c3RHcldWV0JYV2RSWW04WUxtQkxDWVVMbmN3YzF5a2dtdEdMMnBvN0hZNmtyOXVDZUFFVXFLMzdpLVBNVTIxbXp0WjNORElxS2RXSFl1cm1nYWNNRm4xbmxwSVI5MDRqdlB6V0tBQjlUZ3hzcnRyUzVLdEgtN2lWMXJmaDZZeW9Xel9mUF9fZk5CdXlqUHZn?oc=5","g":["ord"]},{"t":"Oriental Rail Infrastructure Wins Rs 4.11 Crore ICF Seats Order, Shares Trade Higher","s":"Dalal Street Investment Journal","d":1795675499,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQVXVDRV9sT2ZpRThKdGJNVEhHRGpQSHJhWFd4RThITGNra1F2dWF1YmJDMWlvWDAxVXRPcmFIaHoxeTNtalJDNFg4b1FRbW1MYnN2UV96SWp